      "messages": {
        "202450000": {
          "id": 202450000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Birdie's lunch today: corn, quinoa, and mashed peas (don't forget to drink water!)",
          "next": [
            202450001,
            202450002
          ]
        },
        "202450001": {
          "id": 202450001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "That's a lot of greens. Didn't spot any meat in there",
          "next": [
            202450003
          ]
        },
        "202450002": {
          "id": 202450002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "So this is what you eat to protect your voice? So meticulous. No wonder you're such a big star!",
          "next": [
            202450003
          ]
        },
        "202450003": {
          "id": 202450003,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "next": [
            202450004
          ]
        },
        "202450004": {
          "id": 202450004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Sorry! I meant to send that to myself, but I hit the wrong chat",
          "next": [
            202450005
          ]
        },
        "202450005": {
          "id": 202450005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Do you remember when I told you I found a little baby bird with a broken wing?",
          "next": [
            202450006
          ]
        },
        "202450006": {
          "id": 202450006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "That recipe's not for me. I made it for the little bird",
          "next": [
            202450007
          ]
        },
        "202450007": {
          "id": 202450007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "It's all better now, and its feathers have grown back",
          "next": [
            202450008
          ]
        },
        "202450008": {
          "id": 202450008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "I'm almost home. Wanna see how it's doing now?",
          "next": [
            202450009,
            202450010
          ]
        },
        "202450009": {
          "id": 202450009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Robin and birdie. Aww, that's so adorable",
          "next": [
            202450011
          ]
        },
        "202450010": {
          "id": 202450010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "That little bird raised by you must be a proper little chonk by now!",
          "next": [
            202450011
          ]
        },
        "202450011": {
          "id": 202450011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend Robin has gone offline",
          "next": [
            202450012
          ]
        },
        "202450012": {
          "id": 202450012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend Robin has come online",
          "next": [
            202450013
          ]
        },
        "202450013": {
          "id": 202450013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Your friend is typing...",
          "next": [
            202450014
          ]
        },
        "202450014": {
          "id": 202450014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "I'm home, but the little bird is gone",
          "next": [
            202450015
          ]
        },
        "202450015": {
          "id": 202450015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "It must've flown off through the open window",
          "next": [
            202450016,
            202450019,
            202450021
          ]
        },
        "202450016": {
          "id": 202450016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Ah... don't be sad. Maybe it's just ready to fly on its own now",
          "next": [
            202450017
          ]
        },
        "202450017": {
          "id": 202450017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Thanks for the comfort. I had the same thought~",
          "next": [
            202450018
          ]
        },
        "202450018": {
          "id": 202450018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "I've been looking forward to the day it flies free again",
          "next": [
            202450023
          ]
        },
        "202450019": {
          "id": 202450019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Even if it came a little suddenly... you were waiting for it to take off into the skies again too, weren't you?",
          "next": [
            202450020
          ]
        },
        "202450020": {
          "id": 202450020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Mm, I knew you'd understand",
          "next": [
            202450023
          ]
        },
        "202450021": {
          "id": 202450021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "The little bird's starting its new life and adventure! It won't forget you",
          "next": [
            202450022
          ]
        },
        "202450022": {
          "id": 202450022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Yep! I've actually been looking forward to the day it flies free again",
          "next": [
            202450023
          ]
        },
        "202450023": {
          "id": 202450023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "It used to fly up to the windowsill and look out at the world all the time. This time, I guess it was finally ready",
          "next": [
            202450024
          ]
        },
        "202450024": {
          "id": 202450024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "It's a shame I didn't get to see it spread its wings and take off, though",
          "next": [
            202450025
          ]
        },
        "202450025": {
          "id": 202450025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Chirp, chirp! Hoot, hoot! Tweet! Tweet!",
          "next": [
            202450026
          ]
        },
        "202450026": {
          "id": 202450026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "System",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Voice message converted to text (free-spirited high notes detected)",
          "next": [
            202450027
          ]
        },
        "202450027": {
          "id": 202450027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "Haha, that's the three little musicians beside me",
          "next": [
            202450028
          ]
        },
        "202450028": {
          "id": 202450028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1309,
          "text": "They're saying the bird must've looked beautiful as it flew away",
          "next": [
            202450029
          ]
        },
